Regular takes Price
Return Price
End (Regular)

VIP takes Price
Put Price times 80 over 100 into Result
Return Result
End (VIP)

Campaign takes Price
If Price is less than 100
Return Price
End (Campaign boundary)
Put Price times 75 over 100 into Result
Return Result
End (Campaign)

Apply takes Strategy and Price
If Strategy is mysterious
Return "invalid"
End (Missing strategy)
Call Strategy with Price into Result
Return Result
End (Apply)

Call Apply with Regular, 100 into RegularPrice
Call Apply with VIP, 100 into VIPPrice
Call Apply with Campaign, 100 into CampaignPrice
Call Apply with Campaign, 80 into BoundaryPrice
Call Apply with mysterious, 100 into MissingPrice

Put "strategy=regular:" plus RegularPrice into Summary
Put Summary plus ";vip:" into Summary
Put Summary plus VIPPrice into Summary
Put Summary plus ";campaign:" into Summary
Put Summary plus CampaignPrice into Summary
Put Summary plus ";below:" into Summary
Put Summary plus BoundaryPrice into Summary
Put Summary plus ";missing:" into Summary
Put Summary plus MissingPrice into Summary
Print Summary
